OL,3,AFlash flood on Nepal-Tibet border kills
OL,4,Amore than 150, with hundreds of
OL,5,Atourists missing
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than 150 people have been killed
OL,8,Fin Nepal, and hundreds of tourists are
OL,9,Fmissing, after a massive flash flood
OL,10,Fand mudslide
OL,12,FThe missing tourists include more than
OL,13,F100 from India, 54 from the US, 34 from
OL,14,FAustralia,and 33 from the UK, as well
OL,15,Fas more than 100 from Nepal itself,
OL,16,Faccording to Nepal's tourist board. The
OL,17,Farea is popular with pilgrims and
OL,18,Ftrekkers
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
