OL,3,AFlash flood on Nepal-Tibet border kills
OL,4,Amore than 150, with hundreds of
OL,5,Atourists missing
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn Tibet, Chinese state media report
OL,8,Fthree dead and 265 missing. CCTV from
OL,9,FTibet shows a wall of water and mud
OL,10,Fhitting buildings at a border crossing
OL,12,FDozens of Nepalese police officers and
OL,13,Farmy personnel are also missing, as
OL,14,Fwell as power workers. My family was
OL,15,Fswept away in front of me, one woman
OL,16,Ftells us - she and her son survived by
OL,17,Fclimbing to a rooftop
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
